  'Supplementary Application (Ministry of Transportation). Section 1 (plates owned by someone other than the vehicle owner) names CarmaCars, the lessee, under a Lease and under a Transfer of a leased car; CarmaCars'' signing officer certifies it. Section 2 (two registrants) names the owner and CarmaCars under Co-Registrant; the owner signs the first line and CarmaCars'' signing officer the second. Left blank on purpose: sex, the office-use registrant types, the mailing address (the same as the address), the signatures and their dates (signed in ink) and section 3 (no operating name is recorded). Only the empty text boxes are filled; the publisher''s PDF is otherwise unchanged. Checkboxes and drop-downs are left for the person at the counter, and every signature and its date are written in ink there. Mapping checked against the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/65d44654-5ed9-4106-9d1a-260f5158fe27/resource/d0cb7203-79fa-4e37-bee6-869621afdad4/download/sr-lv-012e.pdf, SHA-256 75e413f4dc37d8416b44d93c4cb5b2e42cf9251d5e51e74c585d00d5c15ad0ed); check it with a preview before use.');
