  '{"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].new[0]":{"source":"corporation.rin_missing","type":"checkbox","when":"corporation.applies"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].orgName[0]":{"source":"corporation.registry_name","when":"corporation.applies","required":true},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].existingRIN[0]":{"source":"corporation.rin","transform":"upper"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].operatedOut[0]":{"source":"corporation.applies","type":"checkbox"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].corpFirstName[0]":{"source":"owner.first_name"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].corpLastName[0]":{"source":"owner.last_name"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].corpMiddleIntial[0]":{"source":"owner.middle_name"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].telNo[0]":{"source":"owner.phone","transform":"phone"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].corpEmail[0]":{"source":"owner.email"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].dlNo[0]":{"source":"owner.licence_number","transform":"upper"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].unitNo[0]":{"source":"owner.unit","transform":"upper"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].streetNo[0]":{"source":"owner.street_number"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].streetName[0]":{"source":"owner.street_name"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].city[0]":{"source":"owner.city"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].postalCode[0]":{"source":"owner.postal_code","transform":"postal"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].sig1[0].signature[0]":{"type":"signature"},"form1[0].page1[0].body[0].sig1[0].name[0]":{"source":"corporation.signer_name","transform":"upper"}}'::jsonb,
  'Proof of Business Address, obtaining or amending a Registrant Identification Number (RIN): the owner''s corporation needs a RIN to be the vehicle''s registrant under a Lease. The publisher''s PDF is an Adobe dynamic form (XFA): its values are written in the form''s own data, and it opens in Adobe Acrobat Reader, like the download itself. To tick at the counter: "New" (a corporation with no RIN yet) and "operated out of the owner''s place of residence: Yes" (the corporation''s address on record is the owner''s). Left blank on purpose: the other purposes (name or address change, merge, amalgamation), whether the vehicles are kept at this address (the owner answers), the post office box, the province (the form shows Ontario), the date of the signature and the office-use block. Only the empty text boxes are filled; the publisher''s PDF is otherwise unchanged. Checkboxes and drop-downs are left for the person at the counter, and every signature and its date are written in ink there. Mapping checked against the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/013f8aa4-4c48-4845-973b-6ce3489dcf6a/resource/8939f879-0692-45a3-b29f-e3d57adea913/download/on00453e.pdf, SHA-256 a60e0c5d7bbb3a73b494c1767b9233e1f49e3b32bc27ff1eee1316c777d871f6); check it with a preview before use.');
