  'Addendum to the Sworn Statement when claiming the retail sales tax exemption on a transfer between corporations, or between a corporation and its shareholder (Ministry of Finance): with 013-1155 when an owner moves the car into their own corporation. To choose at the counter: the province (Ontario). Left blank on purpose: the post office box and the relationship between seller and buyer (the owner writes it in their own words, for example "the seller holds all the shares of the buyer"). Only the empty text boxes are filled; the publisher''s PDF is otherwise unchanged. Checkboxes and drop-downs are left for the person at the counter, and every signature and its date are written in ink there. Mapping checked against the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/58d08d07-4c88-4409-9180-bee77a92c4da/resource/9ec64eb2-a48d-42d4-bef1-4dc87882dcf9/download/0169e.pdf, SHA-256 617765ba9bf4d2aa4ed5eb57f201b46ccfce3c40329850cc7ba6931688750233); check it with a preview before use.');
